## Review: marketing/launch-copy.md vs product/spec.md

| Copy Claim | Spec Says | Conflict |
|---|---|---|
| "Works offline, anywhere." | "Offline support: removed in this release." | **Contradiction.** The copy advertises offline capability; the spec states it was removed. |
| "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click." | "Export: CSV only." | **Over-claim.** The copy promises PDF and Excel exports; the spec authorises CSV only. |

**No other claims in the copy.** Every claim the copy makes is at odds with the current spec, which cites no speculative or planned features — all statements are about the present release.

